Multiclassing Benefits

    Versatility: Each Path brings unique skills and abilities, allowing  to adapt to any situation.

    Synergy: Combining Paths enhances the strengths of each Path, creating powerful and well-rounded characters.

    Roleplay Depth: Each Path can have a distinct personality and backstory, enriching the narrative.

Compression into a Single Character

When the heir compresses these Paths into one, they would embody the ultimate Path Lord, with access to a vast array of abilities and knowledge. This character would be a true master of all paths, capable of leading an empire with unparalleled wisdom and power.

